	(text "Boot 0 1 2 (towards USB is 1, towards reset button is 0; boot1 open = 0, blobbed=1)\n0 0 0 = 0 forced USB: no sd clk, no flash cs\n1 0 0 = 1 A35 SDMMC1: but no sd clk, no flash cs\n0 1 0 = 2 A35 eMMC: no pins\n1 1 0 = 3 Dev boot: no pins\n0 0 1 = 4 A35 QSPI Serial NOR: two neg pulses on flash cs, 32MHz clock on flash clk (60 pulses each)\n1 0 1 = 5 not valid??: no sd clk, lots of neg pulses on flash cs, 32MHz clock on flash clk (24 pulses)\n0 1 1 = 6 not valid??: no pins\n1 1 1 = 7 M33 SD Card: no pins"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 421.132 173.736 0)
		(effects
